            "heading": "How Beeblend works <em>ee</em>",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_GgME6E": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Bee Blend, we don’t just bottle honey—we preserve nature’s masterpiece. Each jar represents an extraordinary collaboration between our carefully tended bees and pristine wildflowers, resulting in honey of unparalleled purity and depth. Our philosophy is uncompromising: honor the ancient wisdom of the hive, intervene only with reverence, and deliver nothing less than perfection. Below, discover the three sacred stages where 60,000 bee visits to two million blossoms create a single pound of liquid gold. This isn’t just honey. This is Bee Blend—where nature’s artistry meets human devotion, and every golden drop tells a story of patience, purity, and exceptional quality.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_GGGgTw": {
          "type": "button",
